{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2020-024","published":"2020-06-10T16:44:34Z","modified":"2026-09-10T03:45:49.466341874Z","details":"This module enables you to add a configured ReadSpeaker button for text-to-speech for your site visitors.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently sanitize block configuration causing a Cross Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have a role with the permission \"administer blocks\".","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/open_readspeaker","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/open_readspeaker?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.5.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.5.0"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.5.0","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/open_readspeaker/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2020-024.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2020-024"}],"credits":[{"name":"Ide Braakman","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/user/1879760"]}]}